    <span class="pub-marquee-item">Genaition · Workshop Series <span class="dot"></span> Workshop No. 06 · 2026 <span class="dot"></span> Online · 13 June 2026 <span class="dot"></span> Booking Confirmed <span class="dot"></span></span>
    <span class="pub-marquee-item">Genaition · Workshop Series <span class="dot"></span> Workshop No. 06 · 2026 <span class="dot"></span> Online · 13 June 2026 <span class="dot"></span> Booking Confirmed <span class="dot"></span></span>
  </div>
</div>

